    "description": "Title:\nGeoCentral Natural Wonders Gemstone Fossil Lot Collector Sets Amethyst Quartz Agate\nBrand:\nGeoCentral\nDepartment:\nJewelry & Watches\nCountry Of Origin:\nUnited States\nGemstone Color:\nMulti-color\nGemstone Creation:\nNatural\nGemstone Form:\nRough & Polished\nGemstone Shape:\nVarious\nGemstone Treatment:\nUntreated\nGemstone Type:\nMixed Gemstones\nMaterials Sourced From:\nArizona, USA & other regions\nNumber Of Pieces:\n40\nTransparency:\nOpaque/Translucent\nUnit Quantity:\n1\nUnit Type:\nUnit\nDescription:\nDiscover the beauty of Earth's treasures with this diverse assortment of gemstone and fossil sets, ideal for collectors, educators, or as an engaging STEM gift. This bundle includes four distinct kits: a Gemstones of Arizona display featuring labeled regional stones, a 'Jewels in the Rough' Natural Wonders gemstone tray, a GeoCentral pocket-sized rock & mineral box, and a Fossils from Around the World set. Each kit showcases authentic minerals, semi-precious stones, or fossils in compact, display-ready cases, offering a visually captivating experience and an educational reference for adults and children alike. The stones and fossils range from polished agates, amethyst, and pyrite to uniquely textured rough minerals and genuine fossil samples. All are sourced and curated for quality and variety, representing the wonders of natural history. Enjoy peace of mind these items are genuine, accurately represented, and sourced from reputable educational suppliers. Perfect to inspire curiosity, support science learning, or simply enjoy the timeless beauty of nature's creations.",
